  "description": "Overview The ultimate offline hackathon hosted by the Information Science Department of VVCE Mysore! Infothon 7.0 is an exhilarating 10-hour coding challenge held at the prestigious VVCE campus in Mysore. This event unites passionate innovators, programmers, and problem solvers to ignite creativity, foster collaboration, and drive breakthroughs in Agentic Intelligence & Autonomous Systems , with a dedicated focus on advancing Sustainable Development . Why Join Infothon 7.0? Test your skills and learn from industry experts. Showcase your talent by creating cutting-edge solutions that support sustainable development. Network with professionals and build meaningful connections. Experience the thrill of competition while contributing to the future of Agentic Intelligence & Autonomous Systems. Code of Conduct: Follow all event guidelines to ensure a positive, diverse, and inclusive environment. Maintain respectful interactions with fellow participants, mentors, and organizers. Cheating or misconduct will result in immediate disqualification. Ensure a harassment-free experience for everyone involved. Strictly adhere to disciplinary rules; participants must remain on-site throughout the event. Teams will be shortlisted based on the quality of their presentation. Registration Fee: Rs. 350 per team Join us at Infothon 7.0 , where creativity, collaboration, and coding excellence come together to build smarter, safer solutions in Agentic Intelligence & Autonomous Systems. Architecting an Autonomous Tomorrow.",
