    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>The ultimate offline hackathon hosted by the Information Science Department of VVCE Mysore!</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"317\">Infothon 7.0</strong> is an exhilarating <strong>10-hour</strong> coding challenge held at the prestigious VVCE campus in Mysore. This event unites passionate innovators, programmers, and problem solvers to ignite creativity, foster collaboration, and drive breakthroughs in <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"607\">Agentic Intelligence &amp; Autonomous Systems</strong>, with a dedicated focus on advancing <strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"672\">Sustainable Development</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Why Join Infothon 7.0?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"764\">Test your skills and learn from industry experts.</li>\n<li data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"866\">Showcase your talent by creating cutting-edge solutions that support sustainable development.</li>\n<li data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"935\">Network with professionals and build meaningful connections.</li>\n<li data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1057\">Experience the thrill of competition while contributing to the future of Agentic Intelligence &amp; Autonomous Systems.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Code of Conduct:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1173\">Follow all event guidelines to ensure a positive, diverse, and inclusive environment.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1261\">Maintain respectful interactions with fellow participants, mentors, and organizers.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1331\">Cheating or misconduct will result in immediate disqualification.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1394\">Ensure a harassment-free experience for everyone involved.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1492\">Strictly adhere to disciplinary rules; participants must remain on-site throughout the event.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1564\">Teams will be shortlisted based on the quality of their presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> Rs. 350 per team</p>\n<p>Join us at <strong data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1647\">Infothon 7.0</strong>, where creativity, collaboration, and coding excellence come together to build smarter, safer solutions in Agentic Intelligence &amp; Autonomous Systems.</p>\n<p><strong>Architecting an Autonomous Tomorrow.</strong></p>",
